Looking at the diff, the changes increase the request timeout from
30 seconds to 60 seconds and bump the retry count from 3 to 5.
These are both reliability tuning parameters, so a single subject
covering them both would be appropriate. Per the Conventional
Commits spec and the 50-character subject limit, I'd suggest:

```
chore: increase timeout and retries for reliability
```

That comes in at 49 characters and accurately describes the
intent of the change.
